<title>USA: Majestic Management reverse split OK'd.</title>
<headline>Majestic Management reverse split OK'd.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Majestic Management and Development Corp said Thursday its shareholders had approved a one-for-two reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The reverse split is effective today and leaves 4,636,227 shares outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>Majestic Development was formed in June 1992 to develop and manage gaming facilities in states that allow commercial gaming.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
